        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ارزیابی کردن",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ارزیابی کردن (arzyâbi kardan) — \"to assess, to evaluate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "معلم کار هر دانش آموز را ارزیابی میکند. mo'allem kâr-e har dânesh âmuz râ arzyâbi mikonad. The teacher assesses each pupil's work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Arz \"worth\" + yâbi \"finding\", from yâftan, + kardan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ارزیابی is a modern native coinage built from arz \"worth\", the stem behind arzesh \"value\", + yâbi \"finding\", built on yâb-, the present stem of yâftan \"to find\". To assess is to find the worth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
