              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تضمین کردن (tazmin kardan) — \"to guarantee\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هیچ کس نمیتواند موفقیت را تضمین کند. hich kas nemitavânad movaffaqiyat râ tazmin konad. Nobody can guarantee success."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Tazmin \"guarantee\" + kardan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تضمین is usually traced to Arabic taḍmīn \"guaranteeing\"; Persian says the Arabic ḍ as z. Kardan \"to do\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
