          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خطر کردن (khatar kardan) — \"to take a risk\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او خطر کرد و شغلش را عوض کرد. u khatar kard va shoghlash râ 'avaz kard. He took a risk and changed his job."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Khatar \"danger\" + kardan. Literary; everyday speech says risk kardan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خطر was borrowed from Arabic khaṭar \"danger\" (EtymDB); with the inherited Persian verb kardan it means to face the danger."
            }
          ]
        },
